  "job_B3.5.11_20251003_114753": {
    "text": "Larspel to swylcere tide swa man wile.\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, \u00feis synt halige dagas & gastlice & ussum sawlum l\u00e6cedomlice, & we micle nyd\u00feearfe\nBe \u00f0am us trymede & l\u00e6rde se apostol sanctus Petrus & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sobrii estote.\nBio\u00f0 ge, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, gest\u00e6\u00f0ige on eowrum life, & symle on Godes willan & on godum weorcum\n\u00deam we \u00feanne magon, gif we anr\u00e6dlice onginnan willa\u00f0, \u00f0urh halige d\u00e6da & \u00feurh f\u00e6sten & \u00feurh\n\u00d0urh diofles facen & \u00feurh his inwit we wurdon on fyrm\u00f0e beswicene, and for Adames gewyrhtum we\nFor \u00f0an we nabba\u00f0 her nanne f\u00e6stlicne sta\u00f0ol ne langsumne e\u00f0el, ac we gelomlice gehyra\u00f0 &\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 se apostol be \u00f0an, sanctus Paulus: Dum sumus in corpore peregrinamur a domino.\nSwa lange swa we bio\u00f0 on \u00feyssum deadlicum life & on \u00feyssum menniscan gecynde, swa lange we bio\u00f0\nHw\u00e6t is \u00f0is deadlice lif elcor nym\u00f0e hit is se weg \u00fee we sculon on faran \u00e6ghwylc man to swa\nUton we \u00feonne ge\u00feencan hu dysiglic \u00fe\u00e6t sie \u00fe\u00e6t se man onginne on hwylcne si\u00f0f\u00e6t feran & ful werig\nSwa \u00feonne bi\u00f0 ful earmlic \u00fe\u00e6t se man on \u00feysse worulde swince ymb \u00f0as hwilendlican \u00feing \u00fee he\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00e6\u00f0ela lareow sanctus Paulus: \u00feurh manigfeald gewinn & earfo\u00f0nessa we sculon geearnigan\nFor \u00fean \u00e6ghwylc \u00feara manna \u00fee for his naman \u00fe\u00e6t wile, \u00fe\u00e6t he arf\u00e6stlice mid dryhtne ricsige on\nSwa we \u00feanne nu, \u00feurh missenlico god & \u00feurh m\u00e6nigfeald gastlic gewin, dryhtne fultumendum, we\nN\u00e6nig man o\u00f0erne \u00e6fter dea\u00f0e getreowlice onlysan m\u00e6g, gif he sylf \u00e6r her on worlde his sawle h\u00e6lo\nBi\u00f0 sio geworhte freondr\u00e6den & seo ge\u00feingde micele selre \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00fee se man unne \u00fe\u00e6t him o\u00f0er man\nBi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylcum men micele selre & wislicre \u00fe\u00e6t he hine gehealde on his freodome gesundne &\nBi\u00f0 him eac uncu\u00f0 hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00f0onne begitan m\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6s he \u00e6r benohte.\nNu we geseo\u00f0, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feeos andwearde world is gewitendu & feallendu.\nFor \u00f0an us gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we ne l\u00e6tan \u00feissa hwilendlicra \u00feinga ure mod gebindan & gebysegian, \u00fe\u00e6t\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 se snottra Saleman be \u00f0an: Quodcumque potest manus tua facere.\nGehyrest \u00f0u, man, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, swa hw\u00e6t godes swa \u00fein hand wyrcan m\u00e6ge & \u00fein m\u00e6gen to \u00fean\nMen \u00fea leofestan, we nyton hwylce d\u00e6ge o\u00fe\u00f0e on hwylce tid se dea\u00fe cyme\u00f0, se \u00f0e \u00e6ghwylcne man\nFor \u00f0an us is selest \u00e6r \u00f0am dea\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t we onginnan \u00feisse forgifenan tide brucan, & we d\u00e6ghwamlice\nSio ons\u00e6gdnes \u00feonne so\u00f0lice \u00fea sawle fram ecum witum alyse\u00f0 & geh\u00e6le\u00f0, seo \u00f0e us \u00feurh \u00f0a\nHw\u00e6\u00f0ere he bi\u00f0 eft for us on \u00feam halgan geryne, \u00fe\u00e6r his lichama & his \u00fe\u00e6t halige blod d\u00e6led bi\u00f0 on\nMagon we \u00feonne gehycgan hu mycel & hu diorwyr\u00fee sio ons\u00e6gdnes bi\u00f0, \u00feonne we for ura synna\nHwylc geleaffullra manna is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6nigne tweon an his mode h\u00e6bbe, \u00fe\u00e6t heofon ontyned sie to \u00f0\u00e6re\nHabba\u00f0 we \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, micle nyd\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feas \u00feing begangen & ure inge\u00feohtas\nWe \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t geryne \u00fe\u00e6re dryhtenlican \u00ferowunge m\u00e6rsiga\u00f0, we \u00fe\u00e6t sculon onhyrigan on us sylfum \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 sio s\u00e6gdnes so\u00f0lice Gode andfenge gif we us selfe \u00e6rest Gode \u00e6lmyhtigum onsecgan willa\u00f0.\nIs us \u00feonne eac mycel nied\u00feearf \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fe\u00e6s gebedes on swa myclum swa we fyrmest m\u00e6gen,\nSwylce us is eac to ge\u00feencanne & to witanne \u00fe\u00e6t se man gedafenlice & rihtlice his synna forgifnesse\nNe bi\u00f0 sio ure ben & sio ure ons\u00e6gdnes Gode andfengu nym\u00fee sio heorte sie cl\u00e6ne fram \u00e6lcum ni\u00f0e\n\u00feu, man, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, gif \u00f0u \u00fein lac to \u00f0am wiofode bringe & \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6r gemyne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0or hwylcne\nMagon we \u00feonne, men \u00f0a leofestan, on \u00feam wordum ongitan hu micel & hu hefig sio syn is \u00fe\u00e6re\nNu we gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6tte m\u00e6stra \u00e6ghwylc syn m\u00e6g bion \u00feurh andetnesse & bote gecl\u00e6nsod nym\u00fee\nFor \u00fe\u00e6re bi\u00f0 sio ure ons\u00e6gdnes Gode uncweme & unfenge, & us n\u00e6nig god ne genihtsuma\u00f0, nym\u00fee\n\u00deeah \u00fee se man sie on o\u00f0rum lande feor fram us, we sculon mid ure mode him to gan, \u00fe\u00e6t we mid\nGif \u00f0anne so\u00f0lice ure scippend, \u00e6lmihtig God, ure heortan & ure mod \u00feus gesetted ongit, \u00feonne beo\u00f0\nBe \u00feam he sylf \u00fe\u00e6t bigspel s\u00e6de his \u00feegnum; s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t sum man w\u00e6re, se man sceolde his hlaforde\n\u00dea h\u00e6fde he on his mode micele earfe\u00f0nessa & hreowe \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0one borg astandan ne meahte, &\n\u00dea arode him se hlaford, & him forgeaf eal \u00f0\u00e6t feoh \u00fee he him sceolde.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s o\u00f0er man \u00fe\u00e6s mannes efenheafda, \u00fe\u00e6tte him sceolde an hund peninga.\n\u00dea nolde he \u00f0\u00e6s borges n\u00e6nne d\u00e6l al\u00e6tan.\nMid \u00fey \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6t geascode se \u00f0e hira bega hlaford w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he nane li\u00f0e \u00feam his efenheafdan gedon\nOn \u00feam wordum us is cu\u00f0lice ges\u00e6d, gif we nella\u00f0 of ure heortan \u00f0a inccan al\u00e6tan \u00f0am mannum \u00fee\nUton \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, ge\u00feencan \u00feane fyrst \u00feisse forgifenan tide, nu us l\u00e6re\u00f0 & myndga\u00f0, &\nHreowsian we mid tearum \u00fea heardnesse ures modes & ura synna.\n\u00deis andwearde lif is hr\u00e6d & gewitende & swi\u00f0e gewinful, & mid manigfealdum costungum \u00feeos\nFor \u00f0an us \u00f0onne, men \u00f0a leofestan, micel nyd\u00feearf to \u00f0am gebidde\u00f0 & myndga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we mid ealle\nGif we to \u00feisse eadignesse becuman willen, utan we \u00feonne \u00fea dea\u00f0berendan uncysta us fram ascufan,\nUton \u00feonne nu gelyfan, men \u00f0a leofestan, on \u00fe\u00e6t godcunde riht & on \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice m\u00e6gen \u00fea \u00fee ure\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, utan him sendan \u00fea halgan & \u00fea wynsuman lac, \u00e6rest \u00feone rihtan geleafan & \u00fea\n\u00deis sindon Gode \u00fea gecweman & \u00fea \u00feancwior\u00fean lac.\nNals \u00feehhw\u00e6\u00f0ere \u00fee him sie \u00e6nig \u00feearf ure gife, ne he naht elles fram us ne sece\u00f0 nym\u00fee ure sawle\nGedafena\u00f0 us eac, men \u00f0a leofestan, nu us ure dryhten, \u00e6lmihtig God, swylcere weor\u00f0mynde\nFor \u00fean us mycel nyd\u00feearf myndga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we singallice \u00feyder \u00feencen \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif & \u00fe\u00e6t undeadlice\nUton for \u00fean nu don swa us halige bec myndgia\u00f0 & l\u00e6ra\u00f0.\nSta\u00f0elian we \u00fea dryhtenlican beboda on urum mode & \u00fea d\u00e6ghwamlican mid d\u00e6dum fullian, on \u00feam\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t we moton gefeonde faran mid urum dryhtne & mid his englum & mid eallum Godes halgum",
